    "summary": "Gourd helmet, stitched all over with cowrie shells in concentric bands, interspersed with red and orange coloured glass beads.On top of the helmet are two horns [antelope?] which are attached with string. There is a large hole in the top of the helmet and therefore the horns are no longer supported in their original vertical position. The rim of the helmet is fringed with strings of double cowries arranged in a herringbone design with royal blue, red, and pale blue coloured glass beads begining each string.",
